OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHealey announces #100 energy bill help
OL,4,Afor millions and raises taxes on banks
OL,5,Aand some savers
OL,6,
OL,7,FHealey says there will be "fiscal
OL,8,Fdevolution", with business rates
OL,9,Fretained locally by the end of the
OL,10,Fdecade and mayors getting a share of
OL,11,Fincome tax from 2028
OL,13,FMeanwhile, a 2% tax is announced for
OL,14,Fsome savers and landlords - it's in
OL,15,Faddition to the 2% hike set out in last
OL,16,Fyear's Budget
OL,18,FTory leader Kemi Badenoch says the
OL,19,FBudget is "not good enough, not strong
OL,20,Fenough, not bold enough", while the Lib
OL,21,FDems urge the government to "fix our
OL,22,Ftrading relationship with Europe"
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
